{"id": "u15", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "pa", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 29, "out_tokens": 1318, "cost_inr": 0.03324, "latency_ms": 7240.0, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 29, "out_tokens": 1318, "reasoning_tokens": 1160, "cost_inr": 0.03324, "latency_s": 7.24}], "reasoning_tokens": 1160, "answer": "\nਮੇਰਾ ਏਟੀਐਮ ਕਾਰਡ ਕੰਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ।\n\n---\n\n### **ਹੋਰ ਆਮ ਤਰੀਕੇ:**\n\n*   **ਮੇਰਾ ਏਟੀਐਮ ਕਾਰਡ ਕੰਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ।** (ਥੋੜ੍ਹਾ ਹੋਰ ਆਮ/ਗੱਲਬਾਤ ਵਾਲਾ)\n*   **ਮੇਰਾ ਏਟੀਐਮ ਕਾਰਡ ਕੰਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ।** (ਥੋੜ੍ਹਾ ਹੋਰ ਰਸਮੀ)\n\n### **ਟੁੱਟ-ਭੱਜ:**\n\n*   **ਮੇਰਾ** = ਮੇਰਾ\n*   **ਏਟੀਐਮ** = ਏਟੀਐਮ (ਆਟੋਮੇਟਿਡ ਟੈਲਰ ਮਸ਼ੀਨ)\n*   **ਕਾਰਡ** = ਕਾਰਡ\n*   **ਕੰਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ** = ਕੰਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ / ਕੰਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u16", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "rom_pa", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 37, "out_tokens": 19, "cost_inr": 0.000845, "latency_ms": 302.4, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 37, "out_tokens": 19, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_inr": 0.000845, "latency_s": 0.302}], "reasoning_tokens": 0, "answer": "\nMy account was closed. Why? I used to deposit money every month.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u17", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "pa", "difficulty": "easy", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 24, "out_tokens": 3361, "cost_inr": 0.084265, "latency_ms": 14526.5, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 24, "out_tokens": 3361, "reasoning_tokens": 2667, "cost_inr": 0.084265, "latency_s": 14.527}], "reasoning_tokens": 2667, "answer": "\nHere are a few ways to say \"Your loan EMI is due on 5 December\" in Punjabi, with the most common and natural options first.\n\n### **In Gurmukhi Script (India)**\n\n**ਤੁਹਾਡੀ EMI 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਨੂੰ ਬਾਕੀ ਹੈ।**\n\n*   **Pronunciation:** tuhāḍī ī.em.ī. 5 dasambar nūṁ bākī hai.\n*   **Meaning:** Your EMI is due on 5 December.\n\n---\n\n### **Alternative Phrasings**\n\nHere are a couple of other ways to say the same thing, which are also correct:\n\n**1. More formal / explicit about the \"due date\":**\n> **ਤੁਹਾਡੀ EMI ਦੀ ਬਾਕੀ ਤਾਰੀਖ਼ 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਹੈ।**\n> *   **Pronunciation:** tuhāḍī ī.em.ī. dī bākī tārīkh 5 dasambar hai.\n> *   **Meaning:** The due date of your EMI is 5 December.\n\n**2. Including the word \"loan\" (ਕਰਜ਼ਾ):**\n> **ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕਰਜ਼ੇ ਦੀ EMI 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਨੂੰ ਬਾਕੀ ਹੈ।**\n> *   **Pronunciation:** tuhāḍe karzē dī ī.em.ī. 5 dasambar nūṁ bākī hai.\n> *   **Meaning:** The EMI of your loan is due on 5 December.\n\n---\n\n### **In Shahmukhi Script (Pakistan)**\n\nThe translation is very similar, as loanwords and numbers are often written the same way.\n\n**ਤੁਹਾਡੀ EMI 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਨੂੰ ਬਾਕੀ ਹੈ।**\n\n*   **Pronunciation:** tuhāḍī ī.em.ī. 5 dasambar nūṁ bākī hai.\n\n**Alternative Phrasings:**\n\n**1.** **ਤੁਹਾਡੀ EMI ਦੀ ਬਾਕੀ ਤਾਰੀਖ਼ 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਹੈ।**\n> *   **Pronunciation:** tuhāḍī ī.em.ī. dī bākī tārīkh 5 dasambar hai.\n\n**2.** **ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕਰਜ਼ੇ ਦੀ EMI 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਨੂੰ ਬਾਕੀ ਹੈ।**\n> *   **Pronunciation:** tuhāḍe karzē dī ī.em.ī. 5 dasambar nūṁ bākī hai.\n\n### **Key Vocabulary**\n*   **ਤੁਹਾਡੀ (tuhāḍī):** Your (feminine)\n*   **EMI:** The loan acronym is used directly.\n*   **ਬਾਕੀ ਹੈ (bākī hai):** Is due / Is remaining.\n*   **ਤਾਰੀਖ਼ (tārīkh):** Date.\n*   **ਨੂੰ (nūṁ):** On / For (used with dates).\n*   **ਦਸੰਬਰ (dasambar):** December.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
