{"id": "u21", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 1126, "cost_inr": 0.02874, "latency_ms": 6226.9, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 1126, "reasoning_tokens": 661, "cost_inr": 0.02874, "latency_s": 6.227}], "reasoning_tokens": 661, "answer": "\n**Step‑by‑step calculation**\n\n|  | Principal (P) | Rate (r) | Time (t) | Formula | Interest (I) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Option A** (simple) | ₹1,00,000 | 7 % = 0.07 | 2 yr | \\(I = P \\times r \\times t\\) | \\(1,00,000 \\times 0.07 \\times 2 = ₹14,000\\) |\n| **Option B** (compound) | ₹1,00,000 | 6.8 % = 0.068 | 2 yr | \\(A = P(1+r)^t\\) → \\(I = A-P\\) | \\(A = 1,00,000(1.068)^2 = 1,00,000 \\times 1.140624 = ₹1,14,062.40\\) <br> \\(I = 1,14,062.40 - 1,00,000 = ₹14,062.40\\) |\n\n**Comparison**\n\n- Interest from Option A = **₹14,000**\n- Interest from Option B = **₹14,062.40**\n\n**Difference**\n\n\\[\n\\text{Difference} = 14,062.40 - 14,000 = ₹62.40\n\\]\n\nRounded to the nearest rupee → **₹62**.\n\n---\n\n### Answer\n**Option B (6.8 % compounded yearly) gives more interest.**  \nIt yields **₹14,062** in interest, which is **₹62 more** than the ₹14,000 interest from Option A (simple 7 %).", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
